if you want to get the most out of your  galactic adventure you're going to need  a ton of cash you'll naturally accrue  units as you explore and sell the  minerals you mine but if you're like me  that isn't quick enough if you're just  starting out I'd recommend taking on  submissions head to your near space  station and talk to this fellow  most of these missions consist of simple  fetch quests but they can net you a nice  stack of units or a rare component you  can also grab multiple quests at a time  and as you complete more missions you  can unlock more lucrative objectives  after you've jumped a few systems you  should stumble on a freighter being  attacked by pirates take out the Pirates  and board the freighter the captain will  give you his vessel and you'll be able  to pick up missions from here for the  most part these missions offer a bigger  payout and usually consist of simple  fetch quests with a few more hazards  thrown into the mix unfortunately you  can only accept one mission at a time  from your capital ship  if you find yourself jumping from system  the system pretty regularly make sure to  stop at every Space Station you can to  check out the technology merchants  where's the better the scanner module  you have the more units you'll get for  scanning fauna and flora with an s-class  scanner I made well over a million units  in a few minutes just make sure to land  on a planet that can support life if you  want to make the big bucks though you  should look into flippin cryo pumps you  get new blueprints from abandoned  warehouses so be on the lookout for  those it may take a while but eventually  you will find a cryo pump blueprint next  you'll need two ingredients thermic  condensate and hot ice when the next  update launched you could easily find  traders with these materials however  after the latest patch on PC I can't  seem to find traders willing to sell  them if you have the blueprints for  these items you can craft them yourself  if not you can search planetary depots  instead there are a ton of ways to make  money in no man's sky but these are only  a few of the most efficient ways we  found so far if you found some good ways  to make money leave it in the comments  below thank you for watching
 

